Subject: [PATCH 50/57] =?UTF-8?q?Emulador:=20las=20reservas=20de=20las=20f?=
 =?UTF-8?q?irmas=20de=20c=C3=B3digo=20se=20comprueban=20y=20sus=20desplaza?=
